# auto:system reads the macOS appearance per invocation, so bat follows the
# same switch Ghostty does. delta cannot: its own detection only picks between
# built-in defaults and cannot reach a named feature or a custom syntax-theme,
# so ~/.config/git/umber-delta resolves the appearance and sets DELTA_FEATURES.
--theme=auto:system
--theme-dark="Umber"
--theme-light="Umber Light"
--style=plain
